msgstr ""
"Synchronization start date. Recorded in the state and remains constant "
"until the state is reset or the date is changed manually. Changing the "
"synchronization date in the portal settings does not change initDate."

#: ../../integration/external_portal.rst:521
msgid "**lastCreated**"
msgstr "**lastCreated**"

#: ../../integration/external_portal.rst:522
msgid "Дата последней созданной записи."
msgstr "Date of the last created record."

