"CREATED_MODIFIED, то 2. Если CREATED, MODIFIED, то 1."
msgstr ""
"States by strategy (CREATED, MODIFIED, CREATED_MODIFIED). If "
"CREATED_MODIFIED, then 2. If CREATED or MODIFIED, then 1."

#: ../../integration/external_portal.rst:527
